  "event_preview": "Circuit de Spa-Francorchamps is a 7.004 km (4.352 mi) permanent road course in the Ardennes forest in Stavelot, Belgium, with 20 corners and significant elevation change through the Eau Rouge-Raidillon uphill sequence and the fast Blanchimont left-hander before the final chicane. The 4 Hours of Spa-Francorchamps is Round 4 of the 2026 European Le Mans Series, taking place Sunday, August 23, with a 47-car grid — 11 LMP2s, 12 LMP2 Pro/Ams, 10 LMP3s and 14 LMGT3s.\n\nUnited Autosports' No. 22 of Griffin Peebles, Gregoire Saucy and Benjamin Hanley leads the LMP2 standings on 58 points after finishing second at Imola, six clear of Forestier Racing by Panis' No. 29 of Oliver Gray, Esteban Masson and Louis Rousset, winners at Barcelona and Imola. Inter Europol's No. 34 crew of Bijoy Garg and Reshad De Gerus sits third on 45. In LMP2 Pro/Am, Vector Sport's No. 7 and Algarve Pro Racing's No. 20 are tied on 43 after Vector won at Imola; Duqueine Team's No. 30 of Giorgio Roda, Doriane Pin and Richard Verschoor is third on 38. In LMP3, Rinaldi Racing's No. 5 of Jose Cautela, Mikkel Gaarde Pedersen and Alvise Rodella leads on 49 points, ahead of Inter Europol's No. 13 on 41 and Imola winners CLX Motorsport's No. 17 on 40. In LMGT3, TF Sport's No. 33 Corvette of Charlie Eastwood, Blake McDonald and Alec Udell leads on 44 after winning at Imola, one point clear of Proton Competition's No. 75 Porsche, with Kessel Racing's No. 57 Ferrari third on 40.",
  "event_preview_ru": "Circuit de Spa-Francorchamps — постоянная трасса длиной 7,004 км (4,352 мили) в лесах Ardennes в Stavelot, Belgium, с 20 поворотами и заметным перепадом высот через подъёмную связку Eau Rouge–Raidillon и быстрый левый Blanchimont перед финальной шиканой. 4 Hours of Spa-Francorchamps — четвёртый этап European Le Mans Series 2026, в воскресенье 23 августа; на старте 47 машин — 11 LMP2, 12 LMP2 Pro/Am, 10 LMP3 и 14 LMGT3.\n\nNo. 22 United Autosports с Griffin Peebles, Gregoire Saucy и Benjamin Hanley лидирует в зачёте LMP2 с 58 очками после второго места в Imola, на шесть очков впереди No. 29 Forestier Racing by Panis с Oliver Gray, Esteban Masson и Louis Rousset, победивших в Barcelona и Imola. Экипаж No. 34 Inter Europol с Bijoy Garg и Reshad De Gerus — третий с 45. В LMP2 Pro/Am No. 7 Vector Sport и No. 20 Algarve Pro Racing делят лидерство с 43 очками после победы Vector в Imola; No. 30 Duqueine Team с Giorgio Roda, Doriane Pin и Richard Verschoor — третьи с 38. В LMP3 лидирует No. 5 Rinaldi Racing с Jose Cautela, Mikkel Gaarde Pedersen и Alvise Rodella с 49 очками, впереди No. 13 Inter Europol с 41 и победителей Imola No. 17 CLX Motorsport с 40. В LMGT3 No. 33 Corvette TF Sport с Charlie Eastwood, Blake McDonald и Alec Udell лидирует с 44 после победы в Imola, на одно очко впереди No. 75 Porsche Proton Competition; No. 57 Ferrari Kessel Racing — третья с 40.",
